title: "Is jump a fifth verdict, or a pin on top?"
accTitle: "Jump successor is a pin overlay"
accDescr: "Each successor row keeps one write state. Ctrl+J pins at most one row as the jump target without changing Leave, Pull in, Done, or Cancel."
