flowchart TD
  KEY{{"`**Ctrl+J on a row?**`"}}
  SAME{{"`**Already pinned?**`"}}
  OTHER{{"`**Another pin exists?**`"}}
  WRITE["`**Write state stays**<br/>Leave, Pull in, Done, Cancel`"]
  PIN["`**Pin this row**<br/>↗ jump after apply`"]
  MOVE["`**Move the pin here**<br/>previous row loses ↗`"]
  CLEAR["`**Clear the pin**<br/>no jump after apply`"]
  KEY -->|Yes| SAME
  SAME -->|Yes| CLEAR
  SAME -->|No| OTHER
  OTHER -->|Yes| MOVE
  OTHER -->|No| PIN
  PIN --> WRITE
  MOVE --> WRITE
  CLEAR --> WRITE
